{
    "lesson": 5,
    "title": [
        "Ethan's First Day at the New School",
        "伊森在新学校的第一天"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Ethan is a fifth-grade pupil and today is his first day at the new school.",
                "伊森是一名五年级学生，今天是他在新学校的第一天。"
            ],
            [
                "He just moved to this country with his family.",
                "他刚和家人搬到这个国家。"
            ],
            [
                "He is very nervous because he has to use a foreign language at school.",
                "他非常紧张，因为他在学校必须使用外语。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Mum, what if I say something wrong in class?",
                "「妈妈，如果我在课上说错话怎么办？"
            ],
            [
                "What if I get low marks and fail the exams?\" asked Ethan anxiously the day before.",
                "如果我得低分并考试不及格怎么办？」伊森前一天焦虑地问道。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Take it easy, my dear.",
                "「放轻松，亲爱的。"
            ],
            [
                "No one will laugh at you,\" answered Ethan's mother kindly.",
                "没有人会嘲笑你，」伊森的母亲和蔼地回答。"
            ],
            [
                "\"You're a clever boy.",
                "「你是个聪明的男孩。"
            ],
            [
                "You have studied English for many years.",
                "你已经学了很多年英语了。"
            ],
            [
                "What's more, do you know that making mistakes is the best way to learn a language?",
                "而且，你知道犯错是学习一门语言的最好方式吗？"
            ],
            [
                "Just believe in yourself and don't be afraid.\"",
                "只要相信自己，不要害怕。」"
            ],
            [
                "\"I can make it.\" Ethan whispered to himself before falling asleep.",
                "「我能做到。」伊森在睡前低声对自己说。"
            ],
            [
                "Ethan got up early in the morning and went to the school with his parents.",
                "伊森一大早就起床了，和父母一起去学校。"
            ],
            [
                "They met the headteacher, Mrs. Thompson, at her office.",
                "他们在校长汤普森夫人的办公室见到了她。"
            ],
            [
                "She gave Ethan's parents a student guidebook and then took him to the classroom.",
                "她给了伊森的父母一本学生指南，然后带他去了教室。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Let's give a warm welcome to Ethan.",
                "「让我们热烈欢迎伊森。"
            ],
            [
                "He just moved here, so I hope everyone can help him fit in.\" Mrs. Thompson wrote down Ethan's name on the blackboard.",
                "他刚搬到这里，所以我希望大家能帮助他适应。」汤普森夫人在黑板上写下伊森的名字。"
            ],
            [
                "\"My name is Ethan and I'm from China.",
                "「我叫伊森，来自中国。"
            ],
            [
                "My favourite subjects are history and science.",
                "我最喜欢的科目是历史和科学。"
            ],
            [
                "I like playing volleyball and reading books after school.\" Ethan introduced himself in front of the class and then sat next to a boy with blond hair.",
                "我喜欢放学后打排球和看书。」伊森在班上做了自我介绍，然后坐在一个金发男孩旁边。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Everyone is friendly and nice!\" said Ethan to his parents at dinner, \"I can't wait to see my new classmates tomorrow!\"",
                "「大家都很友好和很好！」伊森在晚餐时对父母说，「我迫不及待想明天见到我的新同学！」"
            ]
        ]
    },
